@startuml
title  Sequence diagram  Broker event -> cache invalidation

participant "CRM API, Shop API [producer] " as Producer
participant "MES API [consumer]" as MES_API

queue RabbitMQ

database MES_DB
database Redis_Cache


Producer -> RabbitMQ: Publishing OrderStatusChanged(orderId, newStatus)
MES_API -> RabbitMQ: Consuming OrderStatusChanged

MES_API -> MES_DB: UPDATE local view
MES_DB --> MES_API: OK

MES_API -> Redis_Cache: DEL cacheKey(orders list related) (programmatic invalidation)
@enduml
